<title>USA: Typhoon Yates powerful but may weaken in W Pacific.</title>
<headline>Typhoon Yates powerful but may weaken in W Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical storm Yates, centred near 16.7N/143.6E in the western Pacific, west of the Mariana Islands, remains very powerful, private forecaster Weather Services Corp. said.</p>
<p>The typhoon may weaken slightly during the next 24-36 hours as it turns more to the north but it remains an extreme threat to shipping.</p>
